kerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":1082602666,"text":"They stop growing after sprouting a few leaves.","nextNodeIds":[731930907]},{"nodeId":731930907,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4264394714,"text":"#They're sprouting! Paimon knew you could do just about anything, {NICKNAME}!","nextNodeIds":[731930908]},{"nodeId":731930908,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":3737581914,"text":"The results were immediate, as I thought... Thank you.","nextNodeIds":[731930909]},{"nodeId":731930909,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":354960954,"text":"Too bad there are no flowers yet.","nextNodeIds":[731930910]},{"nodeId":731930910,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":716748154,"text":"Oh, that's normal. You can't rush such things.","nextNodeIds":[731930911]},{"nodeId":731930911,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":103372290,"text":"Plants have to go through stages of growth. That you were able to make them sprout is already quite amazing.","nextNodeIds":[731930912]},{"nodeId":731930912,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":3327613930,"text":"Give the roses some more time to take in the nourishment. It will be better for them as well.","nextNodeIds":[731930913]},{"nodeId":731930913,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":1077131434,"text":"I'm very grateful to you as it is. I wouldn't wish to bother you further.","nextNodeIds":[731930914]},{"nodeId":731930914,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4232,"speakerName":"Sabbah","textMapHash":3684629826,"text":"Just drop by and see them in your spare time. That would be enough.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7319309,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMO